{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1419234-will-onyx-path-keep-putting-out-products-even-if-the-election-goes-badly","id":1419234,"title":"Will Onyx Path keep putting out products even if the election goes badly?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-20T14:34:49-07:00","id":1419234,"title":"Will Onyx Path keep putting out products even if the election goes badly?","content":"Sorry. Idk as much about politics as I should and this really worries me. Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T14:52:11-07:00","id":1419238,"title":"","content":"Given they've been a game company for 9 years and have industry veterans, I doubt regular politics will keep Onyx Path from putting out product.<br /> <br /> What product they do put out depends on the economy, including shipping and distribution. At least in the U.S., game companies have been impacted by government response to Covid-19. You can't print a book if your printer is closed, which has happened to several companies (the deluxe print of Wolves of God by Sine Nominee Press and the Knights of the Dinner Table Magazine are two products I know of that were delayed due to the printers being closed). Also, if shipping and printing is impacted, that impacts the cash flows from those projects (might be later payment, less sales, different payments for printing, etc).<br /> <br /> Most of the creation of games is intellectual work, so a lot has to be done for a print product even before it gets printed. The Monday meeting notes, if you click on the 'more' in the announcements link, shows a lot of products in the pipeline and the stages they are at.<br /> <br /> Prudent organizations realize that while they can do great work and they can control many factors related to getting great products or services to customers, the outside world does impact them.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't be worried--it is clear from the Monday Meeting notes that there's a lot of thought going into working with everyone to get us the awesome games Onyx Path and its partners want to sell us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T14:57:31-07:00","id":1419239,"title":"","content":"Okay \ud83d\ude0a. Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T15:00:23-07:00","id":1419243,"title":"","content":"However you feel about the potential results of the election, the impact of them is unlikely to be immediate. Even if things get very ugly, people are going to want (if not need) entertainment that helps them get through rough times, and Onyx Path doesn't really need to be attached to a specific physical location for most of what they do. Things might slow down, but outright stopping seems unlikely. Even during the US Civil War, society didn't come to a screeching halt, and while there's a lot of reasons to be worried about an uptick in politically motivated violence, it's doubtful to escalate to the level of a true war.<br /> <br /> Frankly, a lot of things that could really harm Onyx Path in the immediate future are going to come up regardless of the election. The Supreme Court hearing an ACA case is going to happen, and if they rule against the law it's going to make life even harder for most freelancers in period of high unemployment (and job growth isn't in great jobs). That's not going to get fixed fast if it happens, so a lot of the writers are going to have to focus on day jobs and less on RPGs, possibly never really coming back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T15:02:58-07:00","id":1419245,"title":"","content":"Thank you. The first paragraph makes me feel a little better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T04:50:49-07:00","id":1419351,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar617_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"617\" data-vbnamecard=\"617\">Heavy Arms</a> question. Freelancers and gaming companies existed before the ACA was passed. Why can\u2019t they continue to exist after it\u2019s struck down?<br /> <br /> I can fake it when I need to, but politics aren\u2019t my strong suit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25665,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":". 10-21-2020, 07:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T05:34:21-07:00","id":1419357,"title":"","content":"I didn't say it would cause Onyx Path to cease to exist, just that it would be harmful to freelancers, and with how much OPP relies on freelancers it could seriously disrupt workflow.<br /> <br /> Since so few people working on RPGs in general are full time employees with benefits from their RPG work, the ACA represents a slew of important protections on top of easier access to purchasing individual insurance. Those protections all dropping next month, and no real chance of a fix before January when most insurance plans expire, is going to be horrible for lots of people, but more so for people that don't have employer based insurance.<br /> <br /> Basically, the harder insurance is to get, the more it pushes RPG freelancers into spending their time in more lucrative pursuits. RPGs don't pay well, so their health plans jumping up (or ceasing to exist) means doing work that pays more even if they're less passionate about it, because living is more important. If the freelancer pool shrinks, books take longer to make because less people are working on the same amount of material (as well as running into issues regarding diversity in writing and development; these things hit women, BIPOC, and people with disabilities hardest). Even if the freelancer pool gets replenished by people that have stable incomes/insurance from outside the industry, it takes time to get people writing up to standards.<br /> <br /> Image how big of a wrench it would throw into the gears of things if half the writers/editors/developers/etc. OPP relies on had to stop taking contracts because they need to move to a better paying gig. That, by itself, would set OPP back a huge deal in terms of keeping up a pace of releases and thus cashflow (nobody can get paid if no books get made, and if books slow down, there's a longer gap between finishing work and getting paid as well). Even if there's a flood of new freelancers coming in, there's going to be a significant delay just in terms of getting them used to how OPP does things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T05:53:23-07:00","id":1419361,"title":"","content":"Got it. Thanks for explaining that to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T06:08:03-07:00","id":1419362,"title":"","content":"I believe OPP pays half when the transcript is received and the remainder at publication. So when you have something getting released almost two years after you get initially paid......","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T11:00:19-07:00","id":1419397,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1419234-will-onyx-path-keep-putting-out-products-even-if-the-election-goes-badly?p=1419362#post1419362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I believe OPP pays half when the transcript is received and the remainder at publication. So when you have something getting released almost two years after you get initially paid......</div> </div> </div> </div>We have a variety of payment arrangements depending on the creator. And we have often paid before publication when a project has dragged on through no fault of the writing team.<br /> <br /> Penelope: Don't worry, we continue to be cautious in keeping an eye on the effects of real-world developments. Thanks for being concerned!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T12:30:56-07:00","id":1419411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1419234-will-onyx-path-keep-putting-out-products-even-if-the-election-goes-badly?p=1419397#post1419397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We have a variety of payment arrangements depending on the creator. And we have often paid before publication when a project has dragged on through no fault of the writing team.<br /> <br /> Penelope: Don't worry, we continue to be cautious in keeping an eye on the effects of real-world developments. Thanks for being concerned!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you \ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\ude0a","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-10T02:09:05-08:00","id":1422888,"title":"","content":"About the Monday Meeting Notes: Happy \ud83e\udd70\ud83e\udd70\ud83e\udd70","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-04T16:49:12-08:00","id":1431096,"title":"","content":"Is there gonna be something really bad happening on the 6th (Wednesday) cause of the election? People are saying there will be and I\u2019m getting really nervous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-04T22:14:11-08:00","id":1431117,"title":"","content":"No, but yes.<br /> <br /> There's going to be a procedural stunt. It isn't going to change anything this election.<br /> <br /> The bad thing is a party blatantly abusing a system designed to safe guard free and fair elections to subvert them instead. The only reason this isn't going to work, is that currently the House and Senate are divided. If the Republicans controlled the House right now instead, and managed to keep their members in line in both houses, they could vote to make Trump president despite the election, and the Electoral College.<br /> <br /> This many members of one party basically saying that they're willing to overthrow democracy is bad, even if the attempt fails, because nothing stops them from doing it when they can succeed.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-04T23:28:45-08:00","id":1431126,"title":"","content":"Thank you. That explains a lot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-07T02:54:52-08:00","id":1431369,"title":"","content":"Aaaaaaaand the Trump Fanatics decide to stage a Coup to seize the EC ballots, blatantly egged on by Trump. *sigh*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When the cat's a Stray, the mice will pray...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25851-thestray7","name":"TheStray7","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25851_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-07T03:22:21-08:00","id":1431376,"title":"","content":"I hadn\u2019t planned to post anymore to this thread, but...<br /> <br /> I\u2019m just glad it\u2019s over","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-07T04:24:06-08:00","id":1431382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheStray7</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1419234-will-onyx-path-keep-putting-out-products-even-if-the-election-goes-badly?p=1431369#post1431369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aaaaaaaand the Trump Fanatics decide to stage a Coup to seize the EC ballots, blatantly egged on by Trump. *sigh*</div> </div> </div> </div>I watched it unfold on Twitter yesterday. So scary and crazy... I'll be so glad when he is outta of office.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1419234-will-onyx-path-keep-putting-out-products-even-if-the-election-goes-badly?p=1431376#post1431376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hadn\u2019t planned to post anymore to this thread, but...<br /> <br /> I\u2019m just glad it\u2019s over</div> </div> </div> </div>Me too!! Though, I guess it isn't quite over. Sadly there is still some damage he could do. But, hopefully not. And hopefully he'll finally face some charges for all the shit he's done..<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-07T13:30:42-08:00","id":1431417,"title":"","content":"The same people that did this are already posting on Parler that they're planning to come back to DC for the inauguration. The Trump presidency might be officially over. This period in US history is far from.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately this was very predictable. It's been clear for months Biden was going to be picked to be the next President of the US and Harris his VP. All of the craven grandstanding, or honest belief in the cause, to prop up the idea that Trump somehow rightfully won could be excused as simple bad behavior in a different world. In this one, it was a provocation to terrorism and insurrection.<br /> <br /> Fortunately, for now, there's hope. There's enough of a silver of a chance that the US will stop showing who we are (no matter how many politicians say this isn't who we are) and can start showing who we want to be, that for the majority of the citizens, life will slowly return to a new sense of normalcy (for better and worse). So to bring this back to the original point, the walls are holding even if they're left on the verge of collapse, and thus the people inside can take a breath, and enjoy some time doing fun things to get away from the world: like buying and playing some cool RPGs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-07T18:40:22-08:00","id":1431429,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1419234-will-onyx-path-keep-putting-out-products-even-if-the-election-goes-badly?p=1431417#post1431417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The same people that did this are already posting on Parler that they're planning to come back to DC for the inauguration. The Trump presidency might be officially over. This period in US history is far from.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately this was very predictable. It's been clear for months Biden was going to be picked to be the next President of the US and Harris his VP. All of the craven grandstanding, or honest belief in the cause, to prop up the idea that Trump somehow rightfully won could be excused as simple bad behavior in a different world. In this one, it was a provocation to terrorism and insurrection.<br /> <br /> Fortunately, for now, there's hope. There's enough of a silver of a chance that the US will stop showing who we are (no matter how many politicians say this isn't who we are) and can start showing who we want to be, that for the majority of the citizens, life will slowly return to a new sense of normalcy (for better and worse). So to bring this back to the original point, the walls are holding even if they're left on the verge of collapse, and thus the people inside can take a breath, and enjoy some time doing fun things to get away from the world: like buying and playing some cool RPGs.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome \ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\ude07\ud83e\udd70. Like Adventure! And Assassins. And Anima (I love TC stuff, though I\u2019m also gonna back Scion Dragons and Masks of the Mythos too when they come out).<br /> <br /> We can keep talking about this, but you\u2019ve pretty much exhausted my limited knowledge of politics. Or we can find another thread and talk about gaming instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]}]}